  'consent.title': "Parent's consent",
  'consent.lead': "Your child has signed up on Niflaot — Torah lessons as games. With your consent the site keeps the child's email, nickname and lesson progress; the nickname and points are seen by other players on the leaderboard and by the teacher of a class the child joins. You can withdraw consent at any time: write to Office@mychitas.app or delete the account.",
